{"reviews":[{"id":"B086S5CHTD-0","r":5.0,"t":"Good product","x":"I use these as gifts for my business. My customers love them!","h":27,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-1","r":5.0,"t":"All 10 pens in box-nothing wrong with any-they really help dry skin and nails","x":"Love these cuticle oils.  10 in the box and they all smell good-work great!","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-2","r":5.0,"t":"Buy these!","x":"This set is a substantial supply of oil pens, and I never want to be without one again!  I live in a very dry climate, and the constant hand washing and alcohol sanitizing hasnt helped my dry hands or rough cuticles.  These oil pens are a godsend, easy to use and convenient to be on the go.  I will definitely buy again!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-3","r":3.0,"t":"Questionable Ingredients","x":"On the box packaging, the ingredients claim to be: safflower oil, sesame oil, natural keratin, vitamin a, vitamin d, vitamin b5, vitamin e, grape seed oil, silk procaine, thymol, BHA. But on the oil vials, it says that the main ingredient is palm oil. Palm oil is very bad for the environment and I probably won't be buying this again. This product also is not vegan which I forgot to check before purchasing.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-4","r":5.0,"t":"Nice product","x":"First impression: love these oil pens! They smell great and they feel good applying to my cuticles. Perfect size for my gift baskets","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-5","r":1.0,"t":"Don't Work","x":"All of them broke when trying to turn for oil to push out. Doesn't work as it should.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-6","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible","x":"3 are empty and 2 have tips that are ruined plus they arrived 4 days late!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-7","r":5.0,"t":"Value for money and worth recommending.","x":"I usually have a lot of dead skin on my hands, so this can moisturize my hand skin. I think it is very good. After applying the hand cream, use this to apply the edge of the nail. The effect is still very good. More moisturized.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-8","r":3.0,"t":"Nice product","x":"Cute great price love that\u2019s there\u2019s a variety of scents. Only reason I don\u2019t give it 5 starts was because one pen seemed to be opened and made a mess in the box. So all pens were sticky","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-9","r":4.0,"t":"No fruit scents \ud83d\ude2b","x":"I really like the cuticle oil. My only complaint there were suppose to be 10 scents and I only received the flowery ones, which I don\u2019t like.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-10","r":1.0,"t":"leaks","x":"one use only.  not happy as I got these to send to customers","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-11","r":1.0,"t":"Scents are mislabeled.","x":"These would be great if they were the right scents. The cherry and the rose are the exact same scent (rose), the lavender and blueberry are the same scents (lavender), and the jasmine and lily are the same (jasmine, I think). So they have mixed up their vats of oils and I'm highly disappointed because the ones I bought this for are the fruity scented ones... They are for nail kits for a little girls birthday party and the flower scents are not right for what I was trying to do. If you don't mind","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-12","r":2.0,"t":"One came completely empty","x":"One came completely empty. Not sure if it leaked out of was defective from the manufacturer.  The packaging is completely dry so it wasn\u2019t during transport and none of the oils are labeled as to what scent they are so you\u2019ll have to play a guessing game. I haven\u2019t tried them yet, just pulled them out of the package.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-13","r":1.0,"t":"Caused painful chemical burns.","x":"I have been dipping my nails for over 6 months and recently tried this cuticle oil. It caused chemical burns on every single one of my fingers. It is the only variable that has been changed/altered/new to my nails.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-14","r":3.0,"t":"Disappointing","x":"About a third of my cuticle pens came leaking. I use them as \u2018free gift with purchase\u2019 for my business, and couldn\u2019t use those. Disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I used these in my Mani Essentials Bag for my customers!! I love the packaging they are so compact you can easily fit them in your purse!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-16","r":3.0,"t":"Good Cuticle Oil - Horrible Packaging (TYPOS!)","x":"The cuticle oil itself is good but there are some typos on the tubes and it\u2019s kind of embarrassing to give as gifts.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-17","r":1.0,"t":"Not as expected...","x":"Arrived late, almost all of the tubes were leaking or had a broken seal and oil leaked everywhere....","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-18","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute! Super convienient!","x":"Perfect giveaway for my clients! So sleek looking and perfect to keep in your purse!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-19","r":5.0,"t":"Good stuff","x":"Good stuff, easy to use, nails grow much better when using this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great for thank you bags","x":"I love them and my customers have been excited to get them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-21","r":1.0,"t":"Leaking","x":"Oils came leaking in box. Smelled nice tho.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-22","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality","x":"Received in good condition with no leaking! I can't speak for all of the scents because I have most away to my coworkers, but Jasmine smells AMAZING! Consistency was like normal cuticle oil, spread/soaked in nicely. I will say I'm a little upset that the ingredients weren't super clear on the listing. I saw a picture that said this oil was made with Jojoba oil, but the box says Safflower oil. Not a huge deal... I suppose I'll go with what the box says?","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-23","r":3.0,"t":"Very nice, but moldy","x":"Product is very nice and was a good quality and a good deal..... But! Unfortunately the strawberry oil had what appeared to be mold it the tube so I had to throw it out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B086S5CHTD-24","r":5.0,"t":"love it","x":"i love this stuff. i can carry it in my purse. what i love most is that it doesn't stay in the surface of my skin. it soaks in and then my cuticles are looking healthy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers love these cuticle oil pens, praising their moisturizing effect on dry skin and cuticles and finding them convenient and great for gifting.","cites":[1,2,3,5,8]},{"text":"Several reviewers report quality problems including pens that broke, arrived empty, leaked, or had ruined tips.","cites":[6,7,11,13,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain about scent issues, such as receiving only flowery scents instead of the expected variety or scents being mislabeled and duplicated.","cites":[10,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers raise concerns about ingredients, including palm oil not matching the listed ingredients and a report of chemical burns.","cites":[4,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note packaging problems, such as a pen arriving opened and making the box sticky or oils being unlabeled by scent.","cites":[9,13]}]},"qa":[]}